{
  "title": "Interleaving String",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "type": "matrix",
  "tags": [
    "String",
    "Dynamic Programming"
  ],
  "description": "Determine if s3 is formed by the interleaving of s1 and s2.",
  "target": true,
  "pseudocode": "1. m = s1.length, n = s2.length\n2. dp = new boolean[m+1][n+1]\n3. dp[0][0] = true\n4. for i = 0 to m: for j = 0 to n:\n5. if i>0: dp[i][j] |= (dp[i-1][j] && s1[i-1] == s3[i+j-1])\n6. if j>0: dp[i][j] |= (dp[i][j-1] && s2[j-1] == s3[i+j-1])",
